#
# The artifact-dependency gate's CRLF fixture must be stored and checked out
# byte-exact: with core.autocrlf=input (the local default) Git would strip the
# CRLF line endings, silently turning the normalization test into a duplicate
# of reject-missing-edge.yml. `-text` disables all end-of-line conversion for
# that path.
scripts/ci/fixtures/artifact-dependency/reject-crlf-missing-edge.yml -text
